    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25883" root="ضغن" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَغُونٌ</span></b>  A horse, and a mare, <i>that runs like him
who reverts from the state in which he was,</i> or
<i>from the course that he was following.</i> (AO, TA.
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاغِنٌ</span>.])

